OL,3,GNEWSALarge asylum sites divide society,
OL,4,Asay Greens
OL,5,
OL,6,FLarge-scale army barracks housing
OL,7,Fasylum seekers "create huge division"
OL,8,Fin society, the Green Party's deputy
OL,9,Fleader says.
OL,11,FRachel Millward told the BBC it would
OL,12,Fbe better for people to be housed
OL,13,Fwithin communities and given the right
OL,14,Fto work.
OL,16,F"The best way to reduce the number and
OL,17,Fthis backlog and this kind of situation
OL,18,Fthat we're seeing is to create more
OL,19,Fsafe routes [to apply for asylum]," she
OL,20,Fsaid.
