OL,3,GNEWSALarge asylum sites divide society,
OL,4,Asay Greens
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said it was working to
OL,7,Fhouse asylum seekers fairly across the
OL,8,Fcountry in alternative accommodation,
OL,9,Fincluding former military sites to
OL,10,Freduce the impact on local communities.
